description         Detect file content types with a deep learning model.
long_description    Magika is a file type detection library that runs a small deep learning \
                    model, shipped in the package, through ONNX Runtime.
homepage            https://github.com/google/magika
master_sites        pypi:[string index ${python.rootname} 0]/${python.rootname}

